[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.201",
    "end": "00:00:09.140",
    "start_seconds": 4.201,
    "end_seconds": 9.14,
    "text": "My name is Yinka Ilory, an artist, designer, a storyteller, a dreamer,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.207",
    "end": "00:00:11.709",
    "start_seconds": 10.207,
    "end_seconds": 11.709,
    "text": "and a person who loves color."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.910",
    "end": "00:00:15.012",
    "start_seconds": 12.91,
    "end_seconds": 15.012,
    "text": "I believe that my calling and mission"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.046",
    "end": "00:00:17.348",
    "start_seconds": 15.046,
    "end_seconds": 17.348,
    "text": "is to bring joy to the world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.381",
    "end": "00:00:20.451",
    "start_seconds": 17.381,
    "end_seconds": 20.451,
    "text": "We live in a time where everyone's asking the same question:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.451",
    "end": "00:00:22.787",
    "start_seconds": 20.451,
    "end_seconds": 22.787,
    "text": "\"Who am I and what brings me joy?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.921",
    "end": "00:00:28.559",
    "start_seconds": 23.921,
    "end_seconds": 28.559,
    "text": "Looking back now, I realize this question has followed me my whole life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.627",
    "end": "00:00:32.930",
    "start_seconds": 29.627,
    "end_seconds": 32.93,
    "text": "While joy was always present in my life and always around me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:32.963",
    "end": "00:00:35.433",
    "start_seconds": 32.963,
    "end_seconds": 35.433,
    "text": "I just didn't have the language for it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.466",
    "end": "00:00:40.304",
    "start_seconds": 35.466,
    "end_seconds": 40.304,
    "text": "But what I did have was a world rich of color, symbols,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.337",
    "end": "00:00:42.840",
    "start_seconds": 40.337,
    "end_seconds": 42.84,
    "text": "dreams and affirmation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.408",
    "end": "00:00:48.779",
    "start_seconds": 44.408,
    "end_seconds": 48.779,
    "text": "I grew up in London in 27 Ashby House,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.779",
    "end": "00:00:50.381",
    "start_seconds": 48.779,
    "end_seconds": 50.381,
    "text": "on a council estate."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.248",
    "end": "00:00:56.087",
    "start_seconds": 51.248,
    "end_seconds": 56.087,
    "text": "I was raised by Nigerian parents who moved to London in the 1980s."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.389",
    "end": "00:01:05.396",
    "start_seconds": 58.389,
    "end_seconds": 65.396,
    "text": "My mother from Ondo State, coined the Sunshine State."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.529",
    "end": "00:01:09.700",
    "start_seconds": 65.529,
    "end_seconds": 69.7,
    "text": "It's known for its majestic rock landscapes and warm weather."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:10.701",
    "end": "00:01:14.004",
    "start_seconds": 70.701,
    "end_seconds": 74.004,
    "text": "The people there are warm, grounded and strong."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.806",
    "end": "00:01:20.978",
    "start_seconds": 75.806,
    "end_seconds": 80.97800000000001,
    "text": "My father from Ekiti State in southwest Nigeria,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.011",
    "end": "00:01:26.383",
    "start_seconds": 81.011,
    "end_seconds": 86.383,
    "text": "a place known for its nature and famous for its warm and cold springs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.417",
    "end": "00:01:28.486",
    "start_seconds": 86.417,
    "end_seconds": 88.486,
    "text": "a place called Ikogosi,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.486",
    "end": "00:01:30.821",
    "start_seconds": 88.486,
    "end_seconds": 90.821,
    "text": "and known as the Fountain of Knowledge"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.821",
    "end": "00:01:34.024",
    "start_seconds": 90.821,
    "end_seconds": 94.024,
    "text": "because of its reputation for academic excellence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.058",
    "end": "00:01:35.559",
    "start_seconds": 94.05799999999999,
    "end_seconds": 95.559,
    "text": "and intellectual achievement."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.694",
    "end": "00:01:41.432",
    "start_seconds": 96.694,
    "end_seconds": 101.432,
    "text": "Even before I'd been to these places, I could picture myself growing up there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.465",
    "end": "00:01:42.933",
    "start_seconds": 101.465,
    "end_seconds": 102.93299999999999,
    "text": "being raised there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.967",
    "end": "00:01:44.802",
    "start_seconds": 102.967,
    "end_seconds": 104.80199999999999,
    "text": "But I was born and raised in London."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.835",
    "end": "00:01:47.004",
    "start_seconds": 104.83500000000001,
    "end_seconds": 107.00399999999999,
    "text": "I felt a strong sense of connection"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.037",
    "end": "00:01:50.508",
    "start_seconds": 107.037,
    "end_seconds": 110.50800000000001,
    "text": "and a strong sense of belonging to a place I'd call home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.177",
    "end": "00:01:57.081",
    "start_seconds": 113.17699999999999,
    "end_seconds": 117.081,
    "text": "In the UK, my beloved mother did many things."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.915",
    "end": "00:02:00.551",
    "start_seconds": 117.91499999999999,
    "end_seconds": 120.551,
    "text": "She bought and sold Swiss voile lace."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.584",
    "end": "00:02:04.054",
    "start_seconds": 120.584,
    "end_seconds": 124.054,
    "text": "She catered for weddings and birthdays."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.955",
    "end": "00:02:07.224",
    "start_seconds": 124.955,
    "end_seconds": 127.224,
    "text": "She was an architect of joy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.258",
    "end": "00:02:09.994",
    "start_seconds": 127.258,
    "end_seconds": 129.994,
    "text": "architect of bringing people and things together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.762",
    "end": "00:02:14.031",
    "start_seconds": 131.762,
    "end_seconds": 134.031,
    "text": "In our glass cabinet at home,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.031",
    "end": "00:02:19.036",
    "start_seconds": 134.031,
    "end_seconds": 139.036,
    "text": "she would collect objects of memories she treasured in her show glass."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.638",
    "end": "00:02:22.540",
    "start_seconds": 140.638,
    "end_seconds": 142.54,
    "text": "My dad worked in retail."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.507",
    "end": "00:02:25.776",
    "start_seconds": 143.507,
    "end_seconds": 145.776,
    "text": "Everyone called him Uncle Paul."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.776",
    "end": "00:02:27.978",
    "start_seconds": 145.776,
    "end_seconds": 147.978,
    "text": "He was everyone's uncle,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.012",
    "end": "00:02:32.850",
    "start_seconds": 148.012,
    "end_seconds": 152.85,
    "text": "dad, brother, mentor and therapist."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.883",
    "end": "00:02:35.786",
    "start_seconds": 152.883,
    "end_seconds": 155.786,
    "text": "He brought so much joy to the workplace."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.222",
    "end": "00:02:42.426",
    "start_seconds": 158.222,
    "end_seconds": 162.426,
    "text": "At one point, my parents also owned a corner shop in London."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.294",
    "end": "00:02:44.562",
    "start_seconds": 163.29399999999998,
    "end_seconds": 164.562,
    "text": "It was insane."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.595",
    "end": "00:02:48.132",
    "start_seconds": 164.595,
    "end_seconds": 168.132,
    "text": "We had all the kids after school, people in the estate, the neighbors,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.165",
    "end": "00:02:51.936",
    "start_seconds": 168.165,
    "end_seconds": 171.936,
    "text": "passersby would come to the corner shop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.969",
    "end": "00:02:55.339",
    "start_seconds": 171.969,
    "end_seconds": 175.339,
    "text": "This place became a gathering point for the whole community."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.874",
    "end": "00:03:00.878",
    "start_seconds": 176.874,
    "end_seconds": 180.878,
    "text": "On Sundays, my mum and dad would host church services."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.911",
    "end": "00:03:04.014",
    "start_seconds": 180.911,
    "end_seconds": 184.014,
    "text": "They would lead lectures and sermons."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.048",
    "end": "00:03:06.550",
    "start_seconds": 184.048,
    "end_seconds": 186.55,
    "text": "The words of worship and affirmation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.584",
    "end": "00:03:09.053",
    "start_seconds": 186.584,
    "end_seconds": 189.053,
    "text": "singing and moving"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.086",
    "end": "00:03:11.322",
    "start_seconds": 189.086,
    "end_seconds": 191.322,
    "text": "have manifested in my memory."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.424",
    "end": "00:03:16.193",
    "start_seconds": 193.424,
    "end_seconds": 196.193,
    "text": "My parents loved house parties,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.193",
    "end": "00:03:21.365",
    "start_seconds": 196.193,
    "end_seconds": 201.365,
    "text": "live music, plates of jollof rice weaving in our small council flat."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.365",
    "end": "00:03:24.134",
    "start_seconds": 201.365,
    "end_seconds": 204.13400000000001,
    "text": "Different languages. Different journeys."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.969",
    "end": "00:03:26.203",
    "start_seconds": 204.969,
    "end_seconds": 206.203,
    "text": "All in one room."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.706",
    "end": "00:03:30.474",
    "start_seconds": 208.706,
    "end_seconds": 210.474,
    "text": "My parents brought all these rituals"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.507",
    "end": "00:03:33.477",
    "start_seconds": 210.507,
    "end_seconds": 213.477,
    "text": "of community and faith and pleasure with them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.510",
    "end": "00:03:35.679",
    "start_seconds": 213.51,
    "end_seconds": 215.679,
    "text": "from Nigeria to the UK."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.715",
    "end": "00:03:43.153",
    "start_seconds": 217.715,
    "end_seconds": 223.153,
    "text": "As a child, I didn't realize I was experiencing a daily baptism of joy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.153",
    "end": "00:03:46.357",
    "start_seconds": 223.153,
    "end_seconds": 226.357,
    "text": "a joy that had been passed on from generation to generation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.390",
    "end": "00:03:47.625",
    "start_seconds": 226.39,
    "end_seconds": 227.625,
    "text": "without even knowing it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.492",
    "end": "00:03:51.295",
    "start_seconds": 228.492,
    "end_seconds": 231.29500000000002,
    "text": "Every ritual, every gathering,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.328",
    "end": "00:03:52.930",
    "start_seconds": 231.328,
    "end_seconds": 232.93,
    "text": "every exchange"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.963",
    "end": "00:03:55.299",
    "start_seconds": 232.963,
    "end_seconds": 235.299,
    "text": "carried a deeply symbolic meaning."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.933",
    "end": "00:03:58.068",
    "start_seconds": 235.933,
    "end_seconds": 238.06799999999998,
    "text": "All these were seeds of joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.004",
    "end": "00:04:01.372",
    "start_seconds": 240.004,
    "end_seconds": 241.372,
    "text": "How did I harvest joy?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.640",
    "end": "00:04:07.544",
    "start_seconds": 242.64,
    "end_seconds": 247.544,
    "text": "Myself, I developed, like my mother, the same collective spirit."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.578",
    "end": "00:04:09.280",
    "start_seconds": 247.578,
    "end_seconds": 249.28,
    "text": "She collected objects."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.280",
    "end": "00:04:10.848",
    "start_seconds": 249.28,
    "end_seconds": 250.848,
    "text": "I collected symbols."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.283",
    "end": "00:04:14.718",
    "start_seconds": 252.283,
    "end_seconds": 254.718,
    "text": "A sun, a rock,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.753",
    "end": "00:04:19.556",
    "start_seconds": 255.753,
    "end_seconds": 259.556,
    "text": "hands, a star, a talking drum."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.058",
    "end": "00:04:24.395",
    "start_seconds": 261.058,
    "end_seconds": 264.395,
    "text": "At first I didn't know why I was drawn to these symbols,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.428",
    "end": "00:04:29.133",
    "start_seconds": 264.428,
    "end_seconds": 269.133,
    "text": "but I realized these symbols were memories or things I enjoyed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.166",
    "end": "00:04:31.735",
    "start_seconds": 269.166,
    "end_seconds": 271.735,
    "text": "and things that brought me joy as a youth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:31.735",
    "end": "00:04:33.804",
    "start_seconds": 271.735,
    "end_seconds": 273.804,
    "text": "The Ondo sunlight,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.837",
    "end": "00:04:36.740",
    "start_seconds": 273.837,
    "end_seconds": 276.74,
    "text": "the rituals, the community."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.740",
    "end": "00:04:38.342",
    "start_seconds": 276.74,
    "end_seconds": 278.342,
    "text": "The gatherings."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.375",
    "end": "00:04:41.078",
    "start_seconds": 278.375,
    "end_seconds": 281.078,
    "text": "Visualizing them helps me harvest joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.079",
    "end": "00:04:45.883",
    "start_seconds": 282.079,
    "end_seconds": 285.883,
    "text": "Visual storytelling is how we unlock stories we already carry."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.916",
    "end": "00:04:47.785",
    "start_seconds": 285.916,
    "end_seconds": 287.78499999999997,
    "text": "This is what I do with my work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.386",
    "end": "00:04:50.988",
    "start_seconds": 289.386,
    "end_seconds": 290.988,
    "text": "I don't invent stories."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.456",
    "end": "00:04:53.724",
    "start_seconds": 292.456,
    "end_seconds": 293.724,
    "text": "I uncover them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.658",
    "end": "00:04:56.860",
    "start_seconds": 294.658,
    "end_seconds": 296.86,
    "text": "I reimagine them through my lens,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.695",
    "end": "00:05:01.465",
    "start_seconds": 297.695,
    "end_seconds": 301.465,
    "text": "similar to how I reflect on my personal experiences."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.498",
    "end": "00:05:04.301",
    "start_seconds": 301.498,
    "end_seconds": 304.301,
    "text": "I listened to people's stories and experiences"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.335",
    "end": "00:05:06.637",
    "start_seconds": 304.335,
    "end_seconds": 306.637,
    "text": "and turn them into symbolic symbols."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.738",
    "end": "00:05:10.307",
    "start_seconds": 307.738,
    "end_seconds": 310.307,
    "text": "Because when you visualize something,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.341",
    "end": "00:05:11.675",
    "start_seconds": 310.341,
    "end_seconds": 311.675,
    "text": "when you share it,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.709",
    "end": "00:05:15.045",
    "start_seconds": 311.709,
    "end_seconds": 315.045,
    "text": "you can pass it on to someone else, another generation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.879",
    "end": "00:05:19.416",
    "start_seconds": 315.879,
    "end_seconds": 319.416,
    "text": "This is why I think joy is transgenerational."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.585",
    "end": "00:05:26.824",
    "start_seconds": 321.585,
    "end_seconds": 326.824,
    "text": "We can inherit it from what it was before or what surrounds us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.926",
    "end": "00:05:31.061",
    "start_seconds": 328.926,
    "end_seconds": 331.061,
    "text": "This is what I did in a recent experiment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.095",
    "end": "00:05:35.766",
    "start_seconds": 331.095,
    "end_seconds": 335.766,
    "text": "I asked my Instagram audience, what does joy look like for you today?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.799",
    "end": "00:05:39.336",
    "start_seconds": 335.799,
    "end_seconds": 339.336,
    "text": "And what are your early memories of joy looking like to you today?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.304",
    "end": "00:05:43.006",
    "start_seconds": 340.304,
    "end_seconds": 343.006,
    "text": "And how could they be translated into symbols"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:43.040",
    "end": "00:05:44.808",
    "start_seconds": 343.04,
    "end_seconds": 344.808,
    "text": "that connect with your memories?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.076",
    "end": "00:05:48.145",
    "start_seconds": 346.076,
    "end_seconds": 348.145,
    "text": "Receiving an abundance of responses"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.178",
    "end": "00:05:52.116",
    "start_seconds": 348.178,
    "end_seconds": 352.116,
    "text": "felt like I was receiving another daily baptism of joy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.116",
    "end": "00:05:54.051",
    "start_seconds": 352.116,
    "end_seconds": 354.051,
    "text": "just like my parents' rituals."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.084",
    "end": "00:05:59.356",
    "start_seconds": 354.084,
    "end_seconds": 359.356,
    "text": "I selected some of the answers and turned them into symbols."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.390",
    "end": "00:06:02.159",
    "start_seconds": 359.39,
    "end_seconds": 362.159,
    "text": "A mushroom, a cashew tree,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.860",
    "end": "00:06:04.128",
    "start_seconds": 362.86,
    "end_seconds": 364.128,
    "text": "a sports car,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.095",
    "end": "00:06:07.131",
    "start_seconds": 365.095,
    "end_seconds": 367.131,
    "text": "a palm wine cup,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:07.164",
    "end": "00:06:10.601",
    "start_seconds": 367.164,
    "end_seconds": 370.601,
    "text": "and I paired them up with symbols from my archive."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.634",
    "end": "00:06:12.503",
    "start_seconds": 370.634,
    "end_seconds": 372.503,
    "text": "Ripples of laughter."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.536",
    "end": "00:06:14.505",
    "start_seconds": 372.536,
    "end_seconds": 374.505,
    "text": "Precious joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.538",
    "end": "00:06:17.508",
    "start_seconds": 374.538,
    "end_seconds": 377.508,
    "text": "Connection, sunrise"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.541",
    "end": "00:06:18.809",
    "start_seconds": 377.541,
    "end_seconds": 378.809,
    "text": "and community."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.743",
    "end": "00:06:22.780",
    "start_seconds": 379.743,
    "end_seconds": 382.78,
    "text": "This selection was based on what happened the most."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:23.947",
    "end": "00:06:28.819",
    "start_seconds": 383.947,
    "end_seconds": 388.819,
    "text": "Around 80 percent of the responses carried a sense of togetherness"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.819",
    "end": "00:06:33.624",
    "start_seconds": 388.819,
    "end_seconds": 393.624,
    "text": "through connection: shared, inherited, not individual."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.492",
    "end": "00:06:38.128",
    "start_seconds": 395.492,
    "end_seconds": 398.128,
    "text": "Around 65 percent of responses were connected to nature:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:38.162",
    "end": "00:06:42.132",
    "start_seconds": 398.162,
    "end_seconds": 402.132,
    "text": "plants, sunlight, open space,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.166",
    "end": "00:06:46.136",
    "start_seconds": 402.166,
    "end_seconds": 406.136,
    "text": "feeling through light, texture and smell."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:47.171",
    "end": "00:06:49.706",
    "start_seconds": 407.171,
    "end_seconds": 409.706,
    "text": "About half of the responses spoke about freedom,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:50.908",
    "end": "00:06:55.179",
    "start_seconds": 410.908,
    "end_seconds": 415.179,
    "text": "movement, exploration, anticipation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.212",
    "end": "00:06:56.747",
    "start_seconds": 415.212,
    "end_seconds": 416.747,
    "text": "no restrictions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.514",
    "end": "00:07:00.284",
    "start_seconds": 417.514,
    "end_seconds": 420.284,
    "text": "Some were talking about growth not always being immediate."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.284",
    "end": "00:07:02.486",
    "start_seconds": 420.284,
    "end_seconds": 422.486,
    "text": "Sometimes it was over time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.086",
    "end": "00:07:04.555",
    "start_seconds": 423.086,
    "end_seconds": 424.555,
    "text": "sometimes through struggle."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.956",
    "end": "00:07:07.991",
    "start_seconds": 425.956,
    "end_seconds": 427.991,
    "text": "A small number spoke about stillness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.460",
    "end": "00:07:14.431",
    "start_seconds": 429.46,
    "end_seconds": 434.431,
    "text": "So I took all of these impressions and turned them into an artwork,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.465",
    "end": "00:07:19.470",
    "start_seconds": 434.465,
    "end_seconds": 439.47,
    "text": "an artwork that celebrates the power of transgenerational joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.503",
    "end": "00:07:22.973",
    "start_seconds": 439.503,
    "end_seconds": 442.973,
    "text": "When it comes together, this is the magic you can create."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.541",
    "end": "00:07:26.143",
    "start_seconds": 444.541,
    "end_seconds": 446.14300000000003,
    "text": "But what stood out to me the most"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.176",
    "end": "00:07:29.646",
    "start_seconds": 446.176,
    "end_seconds": 449.646,
    "text": "was that no one spoke about personal achievement."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.680",
    "end": "00:07:34.585",
    "start_seconds": 449.68,
    "end_seconds": 454.585,
    "text": "It was always about people and places, and shared experiences."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.452",
    "end": "00:07:38.055",
    "start_seconds": 455.452,
    "end_seconds": 458.055,
    "text": "All of my responses were very visual already."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.156",
    "end": "00:07:41.959",
    "start_seconds": 459.156,
    "end_seconds": 461.959,
    "text": "It's something we often recognize in hindsight."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.161",
    "end": "00:07:47.764",
    "start_seconds": 464.161,
    "end_seconds": 467.764,
    "text": "To me, harvesting transgenerational joy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:47.798",
    "end": "00:07:50.033",
    "start_seconds": 467.798,
    "end_seconds": 470.033,
    "text": "means finding the seeds"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.033",
    "end": "00:07:52.569",
    "start_seconds": 470.033,
    "end_seconds": 472.569,
    "text": "that were planted before you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:52.569",
    "end": "00:07:56.473",
    "start_seconds": 472.569,
    "end_seconds": 476.473,
    "text": "by your parents, by your loved ones, by your community,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:57.474",
    "end": "00:07:59.142",
    "start_seconds": 477.474,
    "end_seconds": 479.142,
    "text": "even by your younger self."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:59.176",
    "end": "00:08:00.744",
    "start_seconds": 479.176,
    "end_seconds": 480.744,
    "text": "We all carry those seeds."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.746",
    "end": "00:08:05.949",
    "start_seconds": 482.746,
    "end_seconds": 485.949,
    "text": "To be able to see them, we need to visualize them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:05.949",
    "end": "00:08:07.618",
    "start_seconds": 485.949,
    "end_seconds": 487.618,
    "text": "We harvest them by sharing them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:08.619",
    "end": "00:08:12.623",
    "start_seconds": 488.619,
    "end_seconds": 492.623,
    "text": "My parents always said to me, whatever you sow is what you shall reap."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:13.390",
    "end": "00:08:15.592",
    "start_seconds": 493.39,
    "end_seconds": 495.592,
    "text": "I hope today you will reap joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:16.326",
    "end": "00:08:20.597",
    "start_seconds": 496.326,
    "end_seconds": 500.597,
    "text": "Pass it on from person to person, from generation to generation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:20.631",
    "end": "00:08:24.735",
    "start_seconds": 500.631,
    "end_seconds": 504.735,
    "text": "It was passed on to me and now I want to pass it on to you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.735",
    "end": "00:08:26.003",
    "start_seconds": 504.735,
    "end_seconds": 506.003,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:26.036",
    "end": "00:08:28.205",
    "start_seconds": 506.036,
    "end_seconds": 508.205,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  }
]
